    {
      "subId": "101402",
      "subQuestName": "Search for the Cleansing Bell",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10140201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10140201": {
            "id": "10140201",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "Aren't you youngsters in a hurry to find that bell? Hop to it, then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140202"
            ]
          },
          "10140202": {
            "id": "10140202",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "But be careful, I haven't cleaned this place up in a long time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140203"
            ]
          },
          "10140203": {
            "id": "10140203",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "If you were to get dirt on your beautiful clothes, it would take some work to clean up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101403",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Madame Ping",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10140301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10140301": {
            "id": "10140301",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "Ho-ho, in and out in no time... You youngsters really are quick.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140303",
              "10140306",
              "10140309"
            ]
          },
          "10140303": {
            "id": "10140303",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "An adeptus... I haven't heard anyone say those words in earnest for a long time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140304"
            ]
          },
          "10140304": {
            "id": "10140304",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "As to whether I am one or not, child, surely you already understand?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140312"
            ]
          },
          "10140312": {
            "id": "10140312",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh... Paimon kinda knows what you mean, but is also kinda confused. Are you really giving us the bell just like that Granny?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140313"
            ]
          },
          "10140313": {
            "id": "10140313",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Don't you think it's weird? Something's just happened to Rex Lapis, and then we come running up asking for it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140314"
            ]
          },
          "10140314": {
            "id": "10140314",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "Oh, don't be silly. Liyue Harbor has been through a great deal in its history. In that time, it has seen the departure of countless adepti.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140315"
            ]
          },
          "10140315": {
            "id": "10140315",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "But no matter what, we have always performed the Rite of Parting first before any other matters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140316"
            ]
          },
          "10140316": {
            "id": "10140316",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "To cry \"catch the murderer!\" at the top of one's lungs, but ignore the Rite of Parting... That, to me, is what is wrong-headed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140317"
            ]
          },
          "10140317": {
            "id": "10140317",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "Now that you have come to borrow the bell, I guess that perhaps an old friend of mine has finally decided to take matters into their own hands.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140318"
            ]
          },
          "10140318": {
            "id": "10140318",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "So, why would I be unwilling to lend you the bell?"
          },
          "10140306": {
            "id": "10140306",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "The Qixing... Those children stopped letting my friends and I into their counsel long ago.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140307"
            ]
          },
          "10140307": {
            "id": "10140307",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "Still, they've done well recently. We old folks are content to be idle."
          },
          "10140309": {
            "id": "10140309",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "The Fatui? Hah! Child, what goes on in that mind of yours, I wonder?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140310"
            ]
          },
          "10140310": {
            "id": "10140310",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "I'm far too old to be quibbling with them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140311"
            ]
          },
          "10140311": {
            "id": "10140311",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "But if they overreach themselves, I will do what I must."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101404",
      "subQuestName": "Put the perfume and Cleansing Bell in place",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10140401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10140401": {
            "id": "10140401",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Indeed, this is the Cleansing Bell. Hmm, it's in good condition.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140402"
            ]
          },
          "10140402": {
            "id": "10140402",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Let's place the perfume we've prepared inside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140404",
              "10140406"
            ]
          },
          "10140404": {
            "id": "10140404",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Of course. How would I know that the bell was with her, otherwise?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140407"
            ]
          },
          "10140407": {
            "id": "10140407",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's suspicious! But if you don't want to talk about it, we won't pry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140408"
            ]
          },
          "10140408": {
            "id": "10140408",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, yes! That old granny asked us to tell you something.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140409"
            ]
          },
          "10140409": {
            "id": "10140409",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"If you have the time, you can come over for tea. I don't have much to offer, but you can always count on an old lady for a pot of tea.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140410"
            ]
          },
          "10140410": {
            "id": "10140410",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Ha, that tone does not suit you. Still, her teapot is indeed very good. There are none better for brewing tea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140411"
            ]
          },
          "10140411": {
            "id": "10140411",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "When a suitable time arrives, I'll bring a spot of fine tea and pay her a visit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140412"
            ]
          },
          "10140412": {
            "id": "10140412",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, what's the next step in our preparations?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140413"
            ]
          },
          "10140413": {
            "id": "10140413",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Hmm... Next, we need to purchase <color=#00E1FFFF>kites</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140414"
            ]
          },
          "10140414": {
            "id": "10140414",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh! Paimon loves kites! Are you taking us kite flying? Is this our break time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140415"
            ]
          },
          "10140415": {
            "id": "10140415",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Haha, no, no. Kites are children's toys, yes, but they also play various symbolic roles in Liyue's rituals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140416"
            ]
          },
          "10140416": {
            "id": "10140416",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "I will explain it to you. But our next course of action should probably be to purchase the kites first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10140417"
            ]
          },
          "10140417": {
            "id": "10140417",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, sure... curiouser and curiouser..."
          },
          "10140406": {
            "id": "10140406",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "An adeptus..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101410",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10141001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10141001": {
            "id": "10141001",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "It seems my old friends just can't stand idly by anymore.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10141002"
            ]
          },
          "10141002": {
            "id": "10141002",
            "speakerId": 2093,
            "speakerName": "Madame Ping",
            "text": "Let's just hope nothing messy comes of this."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}